|----------|---------|
| **SQL Injection** | Parameterized queries (Doctrine) |
| **No error handling** | Exceptions |
| **Связанность** | Разделение слоёв |
| **Raw PDO** | Doctrine ORM |
| **No testing** | Interface-driven |

